{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220960","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220960","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1322096001:1":{"text":"Daimon! You're alright! That's wonderful!","source_cn":"戴蒙！我的戴蒙！！你……你没事，太好了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x531EA79838BDC0D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322096002:1":{"text":"Mother! I didn't expect you here!","source_cn":"妈妈！你来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D35A0D94DACCD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322096003:1":{"text":"You're safe. I'm so relieved...","source_cn":"你……你没事，太好了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE096CCD1B0E821D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322096004:1":{"text":"I was so worried about you, terrified you might've run into danger out there... When I found your bandage in the forest, my heart sank...","source_cn":"……我好担心你的身体，也害怕你在外面碰到什么危险……你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CC9A6E9955B73AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322096005:1":{"text":"Mother, I...","source_cn":"妈妈，我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E6C42DB111B34B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322096006:1":{"text":"How could you leave without a word?! It's too dangerous!","source_cn":"你怎么能一声不吭就跑到这么远的地方来？太危险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x398D00189F26DB3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322096007:1":{"text":"I told you to stay home, and you snuck out anyway!","source_cn":"我说过你不能独自外出，可你竟然偷偷溜出门……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x637B23D16E7CBF75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322096008:1":{"text":"You haven't properly healed yet! What if your illness gets worse?!","source_cn":"你难道没有为自己考虑过吗？你的病还没好，如果再加重了该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64E01F106D9DFA84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322096009:1":{"text":"Please calm down, my lady. You've found your child, and he's unharmed. Doesn't that bring you relief? Will you listen to what he's finally gathered the courage to say?","source_cn":"女士，请冷静。你已经找回了你的孩子，他也没有受到任何伤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC41D72F1307AFE1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322096010:1":{"text":"What's wrong, Daimon? What do you want to say?","source_cn":"……戴蒙，你到底怎么了，你想说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE74DB5A179A7CC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322096011:1":{"text":"I... I...","source_cn":"我、我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6401115CF7A8F7E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322096012:1":{"text":"It's okay, Daimon. Just tell your mother what you want to say.","source_cn":"没关系的，戴蒙。你想说什么，就对你妈妈说吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD37867D8A3A3B02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322096013:1":{"text":"Mother, I don't want to be protected by you and Father all the time!","source_cn":"妈妈，我不想总是被你和爸爸护在身后了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x696BA2B2E04450A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322096014:1":{"text":"Look! I was able to travel this far away by myself. Even without Stitchy by my side, I was able to protect myself.","source_cn":"你看，我能一个人出远门，哪怕没有奇奇在身边，我也能保护...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA317B08902C6BCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322096015:1":{"text":"I don't want to play alone anymore. I want to meet new friends and go where I want to go…","source_cn":"我不想再一个人孤零零的玩耍，我想认识新的朋友，去想去的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D5078447C24225","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322096016:1":{"text":"I-I want to grow up!","source_cn":"我想……我想长大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DE29E4616942558","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322096017:1":{"text":"Why do you always think that I am weak, Mother? Why do you never let me do anything? Why can't I have friends?","source_cn":"妈妈，为什么你总是觉得我很弱小，需要你的看护？为什么你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE7E3C922F24547","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1322096018:1":{"text":"I don't want to be like this anymore!","source_cn":"我不想这样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x262D4BAA024964C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1322096019:0":{"text":"Daimon chokes out the words in a single breath, his voice breaking. Before anyone can respond, he bolts, tears spilling down his cheeks as he vanishes from sight.","source_cn":"戴蒙一口气说完这些话，流着眼泪伤心地跑开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F99D3C693751F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document